WEBVTT

00:49:57.125 --> 00:50:00.684
"The end of summer of 1919

00:50:00.708 --> 00:50:03.393
was followed by the Tulsa Race Massacre,

00:50:03.417 --> 00:50:06.393
the Johnson-Reed
Anti-Immigration Act of 1924,

00:50:06.417 --> 00:50:08.184
and also the rise of the KKK.

00:50:08.208 --> 00:50:09.518
Is there a possibility

00:50:09.542 --> 00:50:13.143
that white supremacy will get stronger
if we don't seize this opportunity?"

00:50:13.167 --> 00:50:15.101
Rashad, I think this might be something

00:50:15.125 --> 00:50:17.434
that would be great to hear
your perspective on,

00:50:17.458 --> 00:50:18.958
working so deeply in activism.

00:50:23.167 --> 00:50:25.601
RR: I'm having a little trouble hearing.

00:50:25.625 --> 00:50:27.458
WPR: Oh, I'm so sorry.

00:50:28.958 --> 00:50:30.309
RR: No, it's OK.